    "text": "DeepSeek-R1-Zero is one of DeepSeek's first-generation reasoning models, trained with large-scale reinforcement learning directly on DeepSeek-V3-Base without supervised fine-tuning first, and released as open weights under the MIT License alongside DeepSeek-R1. DeepSeek names endless repetition, poor readability and language mixing as its weaknesses.",
